# Reviewed misconfiguration exceptions for `mise run check:scan`.
# Every entry states why the finding does not apply here — an unexplained id is
# technical debt, and a check silenced without a reason is worse than no check.

# DS-0026 "Add HEALTHCHECK instruction in your Dockerfile".
# Inapplicable twice over, so satisfying it would add dead metadata rather than
# health coverage:
#   - the runtime stage is distroless (no shell, no curl, no wget), so a
#     HEALTHCHECK command would have nothing to execute;
#   - the deployment target is Cloud Run, which ignores Docker HEALTHCHECK
#     entirely and drives health from startup_probe/liveness_probe in
#     infra/cloud_run.tf — both already probing /health.
DS-0026
